                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarerfarewelledition-thunderlotus-s2-1200x1600-68df8dd0734a.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Thunder Lotus",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Thunder Lotus",
                    "description": "# The definitive edition of the beloved game.\n\nThe **Spiritfarer® Farewell Edition** is the definitive edition of the award-winning cozy management game about dying. It includes the heartwarming base game beloved by over 1 million players, and three major content updates: explore an expanded world and befriend four new spirit friends! See why critics called Spiritfarer one of the Best Games of 2020.\n\n![Screenshot 1](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarer-thunderlotus-g1c-01-1920x1080-743253717.jpg)\n\n# A cozy management game about dying.\n\nPlay as Stella, ferrymaster to the deceased, a Spiritfarer. Build a boat to explore the world, then befriend and care for spirits before finally releasing them into the afterlife.\n\n![Screenshot 2](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarer-thunderlotus-g2-01-1920x1080-743253662.jpg)\n\n# Build, manage, and improve your own ferry.\n\n**Build** and sail your boat across mystical seas to **explore** a fantastic and imaginative world. Seek and gather resources to craft upgrades for your ship and gifts for your passengers.\n\n![Screenshot 3](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarer-thunderlotus-g1a-02-1920x1080-743252186.jpg)\n\n# An endless variety of activities await you!\n\nFarm, mine, fish, harvest, cook, weave, and craft! Run, jump, and glide your way through elegantly constructed platforming levels. Join the adventure as Daffodil the cat, in **two-player cooperative** play.\n\n![Screenshot 4](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarer-thunderlotus-g1a-06-1920x1080-743252875.jpg)\n\n# Learn how to say goodbye.\n\nSpend relaxing quality time with your spirit passengers, create lasting memories, and, ultimately, **learn how to say goodbye** to your cherished friends.\n\n![Screenshot 5](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarer-thunderlotus-g1a-04-1920x1080-743252636.jpg)\n\nNow includes the free Jackie & Daria Update!\n\n**The Jackie & Daria Update**  The Jackie & Daria Update is Spiritfarer's biggest free content update yet! It introduces a new island to explore, two new Spirits to befriend, a new event, and more! \n\n![Screenshot 6](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-spiritfarerfarewelledition-thunderlotus-g2-05-1920x1080-a72ebed720cf.jpg)",
                    "shortDescription": "Spiritfarer®: Farewell Edition is a cozy management game about dying. As ferrymaster to the deceased, build a boat to explore the world, care for your spirit friends, and finally release them into the afterlife. What will you leave behind?",
                    "title": "Spiritfarer®: Farewell Edition",
